WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: As an Opstack owner, open Opstack console → Monthly report and select a month.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Step 2: In Sales, edit each location’s recurring fee and any notes. Changes begin in the selected month and carry forward until another change.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Step 3: In Expenses, enter the month’s named costs and choose Save expenses.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Step 4: Review Sales, Expenses and Profit, resolving unconfigured fees before using the final result.
